    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HISTORY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Academy of Shadows has summoned Dracula via an invitation sealed with an ominous emblem that stirs long-buried memories. As the newly appointed honorary examiner, Dracula must evaluate the academy's top students. But this will prove to be no ordinary task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344950/extras/1d3a0b949203a29656ac87b3471fe4f1.avif?t=1733303863\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the exam unfolds, chaos reigns! Dracula\u2019s most feared memories have been unleashed. From menacing dolls to broken portals, mischievous students, and vanishing teachers, the academy teeters on the brink of disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344950/extras/82e03bc1343f29961b4bda5f2727e6a4.avif?t=1733303863\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you to help Dracula save the day. Rally a team, stop the runaway students, recover lost magical items, and restore order before the graduation ceremony begins. Along the way, you\u2019ll face fears, conquer challenges, and prove once and for all that the legendary Count Dracula isn\u2019t one to be trifled with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344950/extras/c7f371791d512a1c4b02ab3a27772a15.avif?t=1733303863\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you navigate through the chaos, or will you let Dracula\u2019s past catch up with him? Can you put an end to the mischievous tricks and save the academy from ruin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Incredible Dracula: Academy of Shadows and find out today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upsell Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65 exciting levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step-by-step level guide </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection of rare cards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of magic items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HISTORY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Academy of Shadows has summoned Dracula via an invitation sealed with an ominous emblem that stirs long-buried memories. As the newly appointed honorary examiner, Dracula must evaluate the academy's top students. But this will prove to be no ordinary task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344950/extras/1d3a0b949203a29656ac87b3471fe4f1.avif?t=1733303863\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the exam unfolds, chaos reigns! Dracula\u2019s most feared memories have been unleashed. From menacing dolls to broken portals, mischievous students, and vanishing teachers, the academy teeters on the brink of disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344950/extras/82e03bc1343f29961b4bda5f2727e6a4.avif?t=1733303863\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you to help Dracula save the day. Rally a team, stop the runaway students, recover lost magical items, and restore order before the graduation ceremony begins. Along the way, you\u2019ll face fears, conquer challenges, and prove once and for all that the legendary Count Dracula isn\u2019t one to be trifled with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344950/extras/c7f371791d512a1c4b02ab3a27772a15.avif?t=1733303863\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you navigate through the chaos, or will you let Dracula\u2019s past catch up with him? Can you put an end to the mischievous tricks and save the academy from ruin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Incredible Dracula: Academy of Shadows and find out today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upsell Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65 exciting levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step-by-step level guide </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection of rare cards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of magic items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p>",
